Vendored files
--------------

  packages/ui/src/components/ui/voice-input.tsx
      The Web Speech API type declarations, capability detection, and the
      SpeechRecognition lifecycle in `useVoiceRecognition` are adapted from
      `packages/elements/src/speech-input.tsx`.

      Source: https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements

      Why vendored rather than depended upon: AI Elements ships as a
      shadcn-style source registry (components are copied into the
      consuming repo by design, as with shadcn/ui) rather than as a runtime
      npm package, and `speech-input` is not yet published to the public
      registry at registry.ai-sdk.dev. Modifications are enumerated in the
      header of the vendored file so the component can be re-synced when
      the upstream component is published.
